<title>SINGAPORE: Roly renews Asia contract with Disney.</title>
<headline>Roly renews Asia contract with Disney.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roly International Holdings Ltd said on Monday it had renewed a contract with Disney Consumer Products for China, Hong Kong and Macau.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the licence includes apparel and accessories for children up to the age of 14, a market which comprises about 280 million customers.</p>
<p>It has been a licensee of Disney in China since 1992, and the group is also a licensee and distributor of other children's clothes and accessories for what it called &quot;greater China&quot;.</p>
<p>Roly, listed on the main board of the Stock Exchange of Singapore, is involved in the home decor products business. --Singapore newsroom (65 870 3080)</p>
</text>
